nsion contains compressed image            ZTENSION= 'IMAGE   '           / Image extension                                ZBITPIX =                    8 / array data type                                ZNAXIS  =                    2 / number of array dimensions                     ZNAXIS1 =                 2048                                                  ZNAXIS2 =                 2048                                                  ZPCOUNT =                    0 / number of parameters                           ZGCOUNT =                    1 / number of groups                               ZTILE1  =                 2048 / size of tiles to be compressed                 ZTILE2  =                    1 / size of tiles to be compressed                 ZCMPTYPE= 'RICE_1  '           / compression algorithm                          ZNAME1  = 'BLOCKSIZE'          / compression block size                         ZVAL1   =                   32 / pixels per block                               ZNAME2  = 'BYTEPIX '           / bytes per pixel (1, 2, 4, or 8)                ZVAL2   =                    1 / bytes per pixel (1, 2, 4, or 8)                EXTNAME = 'BPM     '                                                            EXTVER  =                    1                                                  END                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  